      "question": "What is the number of trailing zeros in 10000!? 10000 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350; &#2358;&#2370;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the number of trailing zeros in 10000!?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>10000 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350; &#2358;&#2370;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2497 2497",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2497</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2497</span>"
